    "message": "让保存后的网页自动化保持固定身份并在恢复授权后可再次运行\n\n复用 ChromePage、现有依赖锁和运行宿主，以四种用户用途组织示例及真实 Chrome 证据。\n\nConstraint: main only; preserve parallel changes and original receipts\nRejected: duplicate runtime or Page API | existing ChromePage and authority contracts suffice\nConfidence: high\nScope-risk: narrow\nDirective: saved author metadata alone never proves executable identity\nTested: Controller/editor/dependency/Locator 175; safety 158; scheduler 26; Standard/Developer build and verify; same-package Mac CFT Controller/Page/Tool/scheduled fire/offline/Stop/revoke/bad SHA\nNot-tested: scheduled native Stop/revoke/missing-host, stale Tool Bridge native call, Cloud Control, final Native Messaging/F3/ZIP/CWS, 95+ product score",
